# "You may sacrifice a creature" is one creature (CR 701.21a): with Ornithopter and Gingerbrute both Bot1's, choosing both is refused; choosing
# Ornithopter alone sacrifices it, leaving Gingerbrute, and makes one Beast (CR 608.2c). Loyalty 5 - 2 = 3.

